### 구독 생성 (Slack)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-123",
  "eventType": "BUILD_FAILED",
  "channel": "SLACK"
}

### 구독 생성 (Webhook)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-123",
  "eventType": "BUILD_FAILED",
  "channel": "WEBHOOK",
  "webhookUrl": "https://example.com/webhook"
}

### 중복 구독 생성 (409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-123",
  "eventType": "BUILD_FAILED",
  "channel": "SLACK"
}

### 구독 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/subscriptions?userId=user-123

### 구독 비활성화
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/subscriptions?userId=user-123&eventType=BUILD_FAILED&channel=SLACK
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}

### 구독 재활성화
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/subscriptions?userId=user-123&eventType=BUILD_FAILED&channel=SLACK
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}
